    <Folder>
      <name>Anker, bøye og marina</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>1 Kasjuni beach anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.50629 N, 16.3954 E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Sea grass<br>Wind Protection: Protected from N, NE<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 8-12m, sand and sea grass. Beautiful, narrow, rugged beach with gravel and rocks. Unfortunately also popular with party boats (specially during high season), so not completely quiet. On the east side there is a beach Lounge & Bar, FKK beach in the middle to west side (where the rocks are).<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-F57C00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value><![CDATA[Coordinates: 43.50629 N, 16.3954 E
Sea bed: Sand and Sea grass
Wind Protection: Protected from N, NE
Anchoring ground at a depth of 8-12m, sand and sea grass. Beautiful, narrow, rugged beach with gravel and rocks. Unfortunately also popular with party boats (specially during high season), so not completely quiet. On the east side there is a beach Lounge & Bar, FKK beach in the middle to west side (where the rocks are).]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="name">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="description">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.395405,43.5062927,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>2 Racetinovac bay anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.49361 N, 16.23597 E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Sea grass<br>Wind Protection: Protected from NE, E, SE, S, SW<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-10m, sand and sea grass. Very protected bay with space for several boats. Very clean and crystal clear water for a good swim. Notice: Protected from NE only if anchored completely inside.<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-F57C00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value>Coordinates: 43.49361 N, 16.23597 E
Sea bed: Sand and Sea grass
Wind Protection: Protected from NE, E, SE, S, SW
Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-10m, sand and sea grass. Very protected bay with space for several boats. Very clean and crystal clear water for a good swim. Notice: Protected from NE only if anchored completely inside.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="name">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="description">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.2359738,43.4936155,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>3 Fumija island anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.48194 N, 16.23208 E<br>Sea bed: Sand<br>Wind Protection: Protected from NE, E, S<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-10m, sand. Excellent daytime anchorage, beautiful location and many boats arrive during the day. Fairly busy channel, so waves often come in. Beware of wind changes, with anticyclone weather expect wind from W, NW in the afternoon hours (bay completely open to W, NW winds).<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-F57C00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value>Coordinates: 43.48194 N, 16.23208 E
Sea bed: Sand
Wind Protection: Protected from NE, E, S
Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-10m, sand. Excellent daytime anchorage, beautiful location and many boats arrive during the day. Fairly busy channel, so waves often come in. Beware of wind changes, with anticyclone weather expect wind from W, NW in the afternoon hours (bay completely open to W, NW winds).</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="name">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="description">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.2320838,43.4819461,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>5 Stari Trogir bay anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.48636 N, 16.03802 E<br>Sea bed: Sand<br>Wind Protection: Protected from N, NE, E, SE, S<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-14m, sand. A beautiful spot with clear water, expect to be crowded during high season.<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-F57C00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value>Coordinates: 43.48636 N, 16.03802 E
Sea bed: Sand
Wind Protection: Protected from N, NE, E, SE, S
Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-14m, sand. A beautiful spot with clear water, expect to be crowded during high season.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="name">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="description">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.0380233,43.4863643,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>6 Islands in front of Maslinica (marina Martinis Marchi) anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.39991 N, 16.19793 E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Rocks<br>Wind Protection: Protected from E, SE<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-14m, sand and rocks. A lot of traffic and completely open to waves, anchoring ground is not holding the best. Recommended for a swim stop during a calm day, can be used for overnight anchoring with really, really calm conditions.<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-F57C00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value>Coordinates: 43.39991 N, 16.19793 E
Sea bed: Sand and Rocks
Wind Protection: Protected from E, SE
Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-14m, sand and rocks. A lot of traffic and completely open to waves, anchoring ground is not holding the best. Recommended for a swim stop during a calm day, can be used for overnight anchoring with really, really calm conditions.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="name">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="description">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.197931,43.3999164,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>7 Necujam bay anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.38775 N, 16.32069 E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Sea grass<br>Wind Protection: Protected from SE, S, SW, W, NW<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-14m, sand and sea grass. Very well protected and safe bay, the anchor holds very good in sandy bottom. Possibility to swing anchor in the middle of the bay, mostly Med mooring anchoring (secured by lines at the stern on land and anchor at the front). Very busy bay especially on first day and last day of charter in Croatia (Saturday and Thursday).<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-F57C00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value>Coordinates: 43.38775 N, 16.32069 E
Sea bed: Sand and Sea grass
Wind Protection: Protected from SE, S, SW, W, NW
Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-14m, sand and sea grass. Very well protected and safe bay, the anchor holds very good in sandy bottom. Possibility to swing anchor in the middle of the bay, mostly Med mooring anchoring (secured by lines at the stern on land and anchor at the front). Very busy bay especially on first day and last day of charter in Croatia (Saturday and Thursday).</value>
