        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.35724 N, 16.36703 E<br>Sea bed: Sand<br>Wind Protection: Protected from S, SW, W, NW<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-12m, sand. Provides good holding for a day or night stop but may experience some waves due to traffic in the Solta-Brac channel, including ferries and the high-speed catamaran line between Split and Dubrovnik.<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
