      <Placemark>
        <name>28 Porat, Bisevo anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 42.98227 N, 16.0026 E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Sea grass<br>Wind Protection: Protected from NW, N, NE, E, SE, S<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-12m, with sand and sea grass. A beautiful bay that cannot accommodate many boats and can get crowded. Amazing sunset views and a beach with restaurants. If anchored on sea grass, beware - your anchor may drift.<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
