      <Placemark>
        <name>33 Saplun east anchorage (buoy field also)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 42.7811 N, 16.98921 E<br>Sea bed: Sea grass<br>Wind Protection: Not protected (only for calm conditions)<br>This spot is a buoy field usually (anchoring might be possible outside the buoy field). From year to year the policy of this spot changes so we cannot say with certainty what will you encounter when you arrive there. Do not plan a late sail in to check, come in early and if you find an empty buoy it can be a good overnight stay when conditions are calm. Definitely have a plan B.<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-F57C00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value>Coordinates: 42.7811 N, 16.98921 E
Sea bed: Sea grass
Wind Protection: Not protected (only for calm conditions)
This spot is a buoy field usually (anchoring might be possible outside the buoy field). From year to year the policy of this spot changes so we cannot say with certainty what will you encounter when you arrive there. Do not plan a late sail in to check, come in early and if you find an empty buoy it can be a good overnight stay when conditions are calm. Definitely have a plan B.</value>
          </Data>
