      <Placemark>
        <name>34 Beach Bilin Zal, Korcula anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 42.92358 N, 17.18745 E<br>Sea bed: Sand<br>Wind Protection: Protected from NW, W, SW<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 6-10m, with sand. Anchoring spot is in front of a sandy beach, ground is holding good. Wide anchoring spot and many boats can fit. Recommended for overnight stay in calm conditions.<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
