        <name>40 Lastovo Submarine tunnel anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 42.75829 N, 16.81441 E<br>Sea bed: Sand<br>Wind Protection: Protected from S, SW, W, NW, N<br>Anchoring ground at a depth of 10-14m, with sand. Plenty of room for the several yachts. Submarine tunnel that you can moor up to as well. National park Lastovo fee will be charger for this anchoring spot.<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
