        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.7992835,43.3387919,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>3 Buoy field Bol</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.26088 N, 16.65873 E<br>Wind Protection: Open to all winds<br>Buoy field Bol does not offer protection from winds and is recommended only with calm conditions. Mooring buoys are healthy and they will hold the yacht, but with semi strong to strong winds you will have a rope squeaking noise all night. In addition it is open to ferry waves that pass in the Hvar - Brac channel. Excellent party stop with a beautiful beach Zlatni rat on the west, nice walking or take a street train from Bol to the beach.<br>Reservation: Not possible<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1563-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value>Coordinates: 43.26088 N, 16.65873 E
Wind Protection: Open to all winds
Buoy field Bol does not offer protection from winds and is recommended only with calm conditions. Mooring buoys are healthy and they will hold the yacht, but with semi strong to strong winds you will have a rope squeaking noise all night. In addition it is open to ferry waves that pass in the Hvar - Brac channel. Excellent party stop with a beautiful beach Zlatni rat on the west, nice walking or take a street train from Bol to the beach.
Reservation: Not possible</value>
