        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>4 Buoy field Primosten</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.58385 N, 15.92537 E<br>Wind Protection: Protected from NW, N, NE, E, SE<br>Buoy field Primosten offers protection from almost all winds. Be aware that with strong SE you will have some winds and swell inside. Buoy field in front of town harbour, mooring assistance is provided. In town you can find everything from markets, restaurants, bakeries etc.<br>Reservation: Possible at the number +385959120721<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1563-A52714</styleUrl>
