      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>5 Buoy field Vinogradisce (Palmizana beach)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.15772 N, 16.39 E<br>Wind Protection: Protected from W, NW, N, NE, E<br>Buoy field Vingradisce is a beautiful but very popular spot. Many party boats during the day taking the guests to Laganini bar. During the night it is usually calm, but can happen that you have a party boat beside. Speed taxi can take you to the town of Hvar, they will approach you during your stay (be sure to negotiate the price). Because of it's popularity this is an expensive buoy field, you can ask the prices over the phone.<br>Reservation: Possible at the number +385911718242<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1563-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value><![CDATA[Coordinates: 43.15772 N, 16.39 E
Wind Protection: Protected from W, NW, N, NE, E
Buoy field Vingradisce is a beautiful but very popular spot. Many party boats during the day taking the guests to Laganini bar. During the night it is usually calm, but can happen that you have a party boat beside. Speed taxi can take you to the town of Hvar, they will approach you during your stay (be sure to negotiate the price). Because of it's popularity this is an expensive buoy field, you can ask the prices over the phone.
Reservation: Possible at the number +385911718242]]></value>
          </Data>
