          <coordinates>
            16.3900094,43.1577287,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>6 Buoy field Hvar town</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.17035 N, 16.43889 E<br>Wind Protection: Protected from NW, N, NE<br>Buoy field Hvar town is a busy and very popular spot. A lot of daily traffic from day tours, ferries and private yachts. In 2024 most of the buoys were replaced with a floating dock on the west side, There were only a few swing buoys left to use inside. On the east side is a peer of town Hvar (mostly preserved). Buoys and floating dock is a first come - first serve policy.<br>Reservation: Not possible<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1563-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value>Coordinates: 43.17035 N, 16.43889 E
Wind Protection: Protected from NW, N, NE
Buoy field Hvar town is a busy and very popular spot. A lot of daily traffic from day tours, ferries and private yachts. In 2024 most of the buoys were replaced with a floating dock on the west side, There were only a few swing buoys left to use inside. On the east side is a peer of town Hvar (mostly preserved). Buoys and floating dock is a first come - first serve policy.
Reservation: Not possible</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="name">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="description">
            <value/>
