      <Placemark>
        <name>11 Buoy field Gradina</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 42.98271 N, 16.02056 E<br>Wind Protection: Protected from SW, W, NW, N<br>Buoy field Blue cave is a popular spot, used for short stay during the day to visit the Blue cave. Buoys are not charged, you will pay for the entry fee tickets to the Blue cave. Organized with the Blue cave port authority shuttle dinghy will pick you up and will take you into the Blue cave for a wonderful experience. Best time to visit the Blue cave is from 10am till noon. Some buoys are close by, be sure to try and catch the one that is suitable for your yacht size.<br>Reservation: Not possible<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1563-A52714</styleUrl>
