        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.09198 N, 16.69889 E<br>Wind Protection: Protected from E, SE, S, SW, W, NW, N<br>The buoy field Scedro is a beautiful and well protected spot. Here you will find a lot of buoys to fit many boats. Mooring assistance is provided. Remote and beautiful spots with restaurants in the bay. Be sure to make the reservation at least one-two days in advance, especially in the high season.<br>Reservation: Possible at the number +385976308141<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
