        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 43.17914 N, 16.67552 E<br>Wind Protection: Protected from all winds and waves<br>Marina Aci Vroska is a safe marina located on the north east center side of Hvar Island. Very nice and quiet marina in front of Vrboska town.<br>Services available: Electricity, Water, Showers, Restrooms, Market, Restaurant & Bar<br>Reservation: Possible at link https://booking.aci-club.hr/en/<br>VHF channel: 17<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
