      <Placemark>
        <name>26 Marina Aci Korcula</name>
        <description><![CDATA[opis: Coordinates: 42.95834 N, 17.13704 E<br>Wind Protection: Protected from all winds and waves<br>Marina Aci Korcula is located on the eastern side of Korcula Island, Croatia. This marina is located in the town of Korcula itself. It serves as a turning point for the Split and Dubrovnik sailing region, and its busiest days are from Monday to Wednesday. Be sure to make the reservation several days in advance. Narrow marina and can be tricky to dock, depending on the spot. <br>Services available: Electricity, Water, Showers, Restrooms, Market, Restaurants & Bars<br>Reservation: Possible at link https://booking.aci-club.hr/en/<br>VHF channel: 17<br>name: <br>description: ]]></description>
