      <Placemark>
        <name>4 Blue lagoon anchorage</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: <br>naziv: 4 Blue lagoon anchorage<br>opis: Coordinates: 43.4388 N, 16.17353 E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Sea grass<br>Wind Protection: Protected from NW, W<br>Beautiful anchoring ground at a depth of 8-14m, sand and sea grass. Crystal clear waters ideal for snorkeling, can be very crowded. Caution: A cable runs along the west side of the bay, anchoring is prohibited there.]]></description>
