      <Placemark>
        <name>Mala Luka Bay, 5-10m dybde. Sand.</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Coordinates: 43° 26.57' N, 16° 7.40' E<br>Sea bed: Mud<br>Wind Protection: Very well protected from almost all winds (N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW)<br><br>Very beautiful bay with crystal clear water, well protected from nearly all wind directions. Deep anchorage - lines ashore almost compulsory. Away from the charter circuit, making it a quieter spot (though crowded in high season). Good holding in mud. Note: The island is in the flight path of Split Airport, so expect occasional aircraft overhead.<br>naziv: Mala Luka Bay<br>opis: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Coordinates: 43° 26.57' N, 16° 7.40' E
Sea bed: Mud
Wind Protection: Very well protected from almost all winds (N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW)

Very beautiful bay with crystal clear water, well protected from nearly all wind directions. Deep anchorage - lines ashore almost compulsory. Away from the charter circuit, making it a quieter spot (though crowded in high season). Good holding in mud. Note: The island is in the flight path of Split Airport, so expect occasional aircraft overhead.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="naziv">
            <value>Mala Luka Bay</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.1253817,43.4432509,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Uvala Solinska, sand</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Coordinates: 43° 26.12' N, 16° 8.80' E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Seagrass<br>Wind Protection: Protected from NW winds<br><br>Beautiful cove near Trogir, much quieter than the crowded Blue Lagoon. Anchor in 5-10m depth on sandy seagrass with good holding. Finding sand patches between seagrass can be challenging - sounding is important. Great water quality for swimming. Beach accessible by dinghy. Caution: Watch for sea urchins on the rocks; some ground swell possible.<br>naziv: Uvala "Solinska"<br>opis: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Coordinates: 43° 26.12' N, 16° 8.80' E
Sea bed: Sand and Seagrass
Wind Protection: Protected from NW winds

Beautiful cove near Trogir, much quieter than the crowded Blue Lagoon. Anchor in 5-10m depth on sandy seagrass with good holding. Finding sand patches between seagrass can be challenging - sounding is important. Great water quality for swimming. Beach accessible by dinghy. Caution: Watch for sea urchins on the rocks; some ground swell possible.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="naziv">
            <value><![CDATA[Uvala "Solinska"]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
