        <description><![CDATA[description: Large, beautiful bay on the SW side of Drvenik Mali<br>Sandy/seagrass bottom in places<br>Good swimming<br>Beach directly ashore<br>Restaurants and beach bars immediately behind the beach<br>Easy dinghy landing<br>Much more "proper cruising" atmosphere than staying in Trogir<br>naziv: <br>opis: ]]></description>
