      <Placemark>
        <name>Susac</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Coordinates: 42° 45.78' N, 16° 30.55' E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Seagrass (rock slabs on bottom in places)<br>Wind Protection: Protected from N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW<br>Depth: 7-10m<br><br>One of the best anchorages in Croatia - a truly magical, wild location with a very strong and special atmosphere. Remote island offering splendid isolation. Anchor at 7-10m with shore lines; beautiful sand patch about 50m out, slightly right of center - good holding. More rocks on the left side. Super clear water with great fish life and plenty of fish. Room for about 2 yachts med mooring in the narrow bay. Excellent excursion to the lighthouse - walk up the left side of the valley to the goat track on top of the ridge, passing ruins halfway. Very calm when wind is right. Note: Sheep may wake you in the morning! A must-do destination.<br>naziv: <br>opis: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Coordinates: 42° 45.78' N, 16° 30.55' E
Sea bed: Sand and Seagrass (rock slabs on bottom in places)
Wind Protection: Protected from N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW
Depth: 7-10m

One of the best anchorages in Croatia - a truly magical, wild location with a very strong and special atmosphere. Remote island offering splendid isolation. Anchor at 7-10m with shore lines; beautiful sand patch about 50m out, slightly right of center - good holding. More rocks on the left side. Super clear water with great fish life and plenty of fish. Room for about 2 yachts med mooring in the narrow bay. Excellent excursion to the lighthouse - walk up the left side of the valley to the goat track on top of the ridge, passing ruins halfway. Very calm when wind is right. Note: Sheep may wake you in the morning! A must-do destination.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="naziv">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.50931,42.7628338,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Uvala Borova</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Coordinates: 42° 46.32' N, 16° 49.37' E<br>Sea bed: Sand (with Posidonia meadows)<br>Wind Protection: Protected from N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW<br>Depth: ~10m<br><br>Dream anchorage on Lastovo island - a stunning, quiet, well-protected cove where the boat doesn't move at all! Completely heavenly. Anchor in 10m on sand (good holding on right-hand side) with two lines ashore - look for red arrows marking easier spots to place lines (use binoculars). Be careful not to damage the Posidonia meadows - anchor on sandy patches. Clear water. Many boats during the day but far fewer in the evening. Excellent base for hiking around the magnificent island. Fee: ~35€/night with third night free (collection around 6pm). Caution: Countless wasps in summer - hang a bottle with sugar at the bow to distract them.<br>naziv: Uvala Borova<br>opis: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Coordinates: 42° 46.32' N, 16° 49.37' E
Sea bed: Sand (with Posidonia meadows)
Wind Protection: Protected from N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW
Depth: ~10m

Dream anchorage on Lastovo island - a stunning, quiet, well-protected cove where the boat doesn't move at all! Completely heavenly. Anchor in 10m on sand (good holding on right-hand side) with two lines ashore - look for red arrows marking easier spots to place lines (use binoculars). Be careful not to damage the Posidonia meadows - anchor on sandy patches. Clear water. Many boats during the day but far fewer in the evening. Excellent base for hiking around the magnificent island. Fee: ~35€/night with third night free (collection around 6pm). Caution: Countless wasps in summer - hang a bottle with sugar at the bow to distract them.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="naziv">
            <value>Uvala Borova</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.8223497,42.7716674,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Češvinica</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Coordinates: 42° 46.08' N, 16° 58.72' E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Seagrass (mixed: rocks, sand, Posidonia)<br>Wind Protection: Well sheltered, but not protected from S<br>Depth: ~10m<br><br>Superb anchorage on Lastovo island with exceptional crystal clear water - visibility over 15 meters! Only 2-3 sandy patches available, naturally limiting the number of boats. Anchor in ~10m with good holding; at least one line ashore recommended due to mixed bottom. Calm inside the bay despite some swell outside. Beautiful shoreline. Good for swimming - water can be cooler than more sheltered bays. Limited fish but pretty underwater scenery. Note: Bay is not protected from south winds.<br>naziv: <br>opis: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Coordinates: 42° 46.08' N, 16° 58.72' E
Sea bed: Sand and Seagrass (mixed: rocks, sand, Posidonia)
Wind Protection: Well sheltered, but not protected from S
Depth: ~10m

Superb anchorage on Lastovo island with exceptional crystal clear water - visibility over 15 meters! Only 2-3 sandy patches available, naturally limiting the number of boats. Anchor in ~10m with good holding; at least one line ashore recommended due to mixed bottom. Calm inside the bay despite some swell outside. Beautiful shoreline. Good for swimming - water can be cooler than more sheltered bays. Limited fish but pretty underwater scenery. Note: Bay is not protected from south winds.]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="naziv">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.9785407,42.7682217,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Korita bay</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: <br>naziv: Korita bay<br>opis: Coordinates: 42° 46.32' N, 16° 52.03' E<br>Sea bed: Sand and Rocks (lots of sand, some rocks in the middle)<br>Wind Protection: Protected from most directions except NE<br>Depth: ~8m<br><br>Beautiful, very narrow anchorage on Lastovo island in a magnificent natural setting. Excellent shelter from most wind directions except NE. Anchor in about 8m on sandy bottom with some rocks in the middle. Due to the narrow shape, you need to be alone or tie lines ashore. Part of a Nature Park - overnight fee ~45€ (no buoy provided). Wonderfully peaceful - only sounds are cicadas and lapping water. Perfect for starry nights. Note: Occasional sudden storms possible.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1623-9C27B0</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="naziv">
            <value>Korita bay</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="opis">
            <value><![CDATA[Coordinates: 42° 46.32' N, 16° 52.03' E
Sea bed: Sand and Rocks (lots of sand, some rocks in the middle)
Wind Protection: Protected from most directions except NE
Depth: ~8m

Beautiful, very narrow anchorage on Lastovo island in a magnificent natural setting. Excellent shelter from most wind directions except NE. Anchor in about 8m on sandy bottom with some rocks in the middle. Due to the narrow shape, you need to be alone or tie lines ashore. Part of a Nature Park - overnight fee ~45€ (no buoy provided). Wonderfully peaceful - only sounds are cicadas and lapping water. Perfect for starry nights. Note: Occasional sudden storms possible.]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            16.8675921,42.7721946,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
